<+># 1.5.10 HF\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n- Fixed cover blur\r\n- Fixed white theme accents \r\n\r\n# 1.5.1\r\n\r\n## QOL & Fixes\r\n- Optimization\r\n- Visual Polish\r\n- New gestures and settings\r\n- rip cover bg\r\n\r\n## 1.4.1\r\n\r\n### New\r\n- OTA Updates.\r\n- New design, new feelings and experience.\r\n- More settings, typeface, shapes & more.\r\n\r\n### QOL & Fixes\r\n- Fixes for Android 17.\r\n- Optimization.\r\n\r\n## 1.3.3\r\n\r\n### QOL & Fixes\r\n- Fixed app goes into sleep mode and player dies.\r\n- Fixed background in Edit Tags menu.\r\n- Visual polish\r\n- Some minor fixes\r\n\r\n## 1.3.2\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n- Added LRClib, now more songs will show lyrics.\r\n- Visual polish.\r\n\r\n## 1.3.1\r\n\r\n### QOL & Fixes\r\n- Lyrics support added (LRCmux)\r\n- Fixes and optimization.\r\n- Bug fixes and visual polish.\r\n\r\n## 1.3.0\r\n\r\n### Compatibility\r\nMIN SDK is 32 (Android 12) and target SDK is 37 (Android 17).\r\n\r\n### QOL & Fixes\r\n- Performance fixes.\r\n- Accessibility of buttons.\r\n- Timer in Player, Miniplayer.\r\n- Fixed monet icon.\r\n- Overall better :cry:\r\n\r\n### New\r\n- Queue & Queue editing.\r\n- Smart and compact Search Bar.\r\n- Design improvements in player, stats, edit tags.\r\n- Edit banner in \"About\".\r\n- Share, multi-selection\r\n\r\n## More in 1.3.x updates..........\r\n\r\n\r\n## 1.1.1\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n- Tag editing works again: the tag library is now the Android build, so saving tags no longer fails.\r\n- Clearer error reporting when a tag cannot be written.\r\n- Fixed about screen.\r\n\r\n## 1.1.0\r\n\r\n### Library and optimization\r\n- Rescan no longer freezes the app; scanning runs in the background.\r\n- The library appears as soon as audio permission is granted, no restart needed.\r\n- Album art loads in the background, one request per album.\r\n- Smaller artwork cache and lighter wave animation for lower memory and CPU use.\r\n\r\n### Playlists\r\n- Reorder songs in a playlist by long-pressing the handle on the right and dragging.\r\n- The new order is saved and used as the playback queue.\r\n- Fixed a bug where playlist order was not saved correctly.\r\n\r\n### Last.fm and statistics\r\n- Connect your Last.fm account in Settings.\r\n- Listens are scrobbled using Last.fm rules, with \"now playing\" support and an offline queue.\r\n- Statistics screen with 7 days, 30 days and all-time views (top artists and tracks).\r\n- Switch between Home and Statistics from the compact top pill.\r\n\r\n### Interface\r\n- Compact top pill; the mode selector expands on tap.\r\n- Settings are grouped into sections.\r\n- Cute widget for your home screen :3\r\n\r\n## 1.0.0\r\n\r\n- Initial release.\r\n- Enjoy!\r\n- Report bugs: koonyarei@gmail.com\r\n
